{"id":"ddee155bb5d30192","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity.md","title":"列表语言的产出公式与无歧义性","display":"thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity — 列表语言的产出公式与无歧义性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity","aliases":["73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity"],"display":"thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity — 列表语言的产出公式与无歧义性","depends_on":["[[73-df-pcp-list-grammars]]","[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.5.2, print pp. 413–415; PDF pp. 435–437","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity — 列表语言的产出公式与无歧义性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76b8cfaf4d1fb58a\" href=\"?note=76b8cfaf4d1fb58a\" title=\"73-df-pcp-list-grammars\">73-df-pcp-list-grammars</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3d61b5dd7be385b\" href=\"?note=a3d61b5dd7be385b\" title=\"73-df-cfg-ambiguity\">73-df-cfg-ambiguity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.5.2, print pp. 413–415; PDF pp. 435–437"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k\">\\(I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,a_i,A,B,G_A(I),G_B(I)\">\\(T,a_i,A,B,G_A(I),G_B(I)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76b8cfaf4d1fb58a\" href=\"?note=76b8cfaf4d1fb58a\" title=\"73-df-pcp-list-grammars\">73-df-pcp-list-grammars</a> 对该同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_I,V_I\">\\(U_I,V_I\\)</span> 为其两行串接函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\{A,B\\}\">\\(X\\in\\{A,B\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Idx}\">\\(\\operatorname{Idx}\\)</span> 及索引族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_I,W\">\\(\\mathcal G_I,W\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Idx}(\\iota)\\coloneqq\\langle a_{\\iota(j)}:0\\le j&lt;|\\iota|\\rangle,\\qquad\nW\\coloneqq\\{(A,U_I),(B,V_I)\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal G_I\\coloneqq\\{(A,G_A(I)),(B,G_B(I))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Idx}(\\iota)\\coloneqq\\langle a_{\\iota(j)}:0\\le j&lt;|\\iota|\\rangle,\\qquad\nW\\coloneqq\\{(A,U_I),(B,V_I)\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal G_I\\coloneqq\\{(A,G_A(I)),(B,G_B(I))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{X\\in\\{A,B\\}}\\left[\nL(\\mathcal G_I(X))=\\{(W(X))(\\iota)\\operatorname{Idx}(\\iota)^R:\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^+\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(\\mathcal G_I(X))\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigwedge_{X\\in\\{A,B\\}}\\left[\nL(\\mathcal G_I(X))=\\{(W(X))(\\iota)\\operatorname{Idx}(\\iota)^R:\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^+\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(\\mathcal G_I(X))\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>右端第一个待匹配索引唯一决定最外层使用哪一条规则；是否还有索引决定使用递归规则还是终止规则。重复的 uᵢ 不会造成歧义，因为不同 i 的尾部索引仍然不同。对索引数归纳得到产出公式与唯一推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pcp-list-grammars","status":"resolved","id":"76b8cfaf4d1fb58a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-list-grammars]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-ambiguity","status":"resolved","id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pcp-list-grammars","status":"resolved","id":"76b8cfaf4d1fb58a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k$；$T,a_i,A,B,G_A(I),G_B(I)$ 采用 [[73-df-pcp-list-grammars]] 对该同一 $I$ 的构造，$U_I,V_I$ 为其两行串接函数。$\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$X\\in\\{A,B\\}$；$\\operatorname{Idx}$ 及索引族 $\\mathcal G_I,W$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k","display":false},{"tex":"T,a_i,A,B,G_A(I),G_B(I)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"U_I,V_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\{A,B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Idx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_I,W","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Idx}(\\iota)\\coloneqq\\langle a_{\\iota(j)}:0\\le j<|\\iota|\\rangle,\\qquad\nW\\coloneqq\\{(A,U_I),(B,V_I)\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal G_I\\coloneqq\\{(A,G_A(I)),(B,G_B(I))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{X\\in\\{A,B\\}}\\left[\nL(\\mathcal G_I(X))=\\{(W(X))(\\iota)\\operatorname{Idx}(\\iota)^R:\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^+\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Unambiguous}(\\mathcal G_I(X))\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1788,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-pcp-list-language-and-unambiguity|列表语言的产出公式与无歧义性]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"4eb90c09079841ed","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["76b8cfaf4d1fb58a","a3d61b5dd7be385b"]}